[color=#FFD1ED]I'm Gabi, from Colombia, 20 years old.[/color]

[color=#FCD4EE]At one point, I was ranked #1 nationally in osu! Standard (when I was 15)... although I still find it hard to say without feeling like it was just luck, weird timing, or simply being in the right place for the right time.[/color]

[color=#FAD7EF]I don't consider myself a "pro."[/color]
[color=#F7DAF1]Just someone obsessed with understanding things thoroughly: the patterns, the rhythm, the reasons behind the mistakes. My progress didn't come so much from grinding, but from feeling the game, from imagination, and from what was once a dream, almost without warning.[/color]
[color=#F4DDF2]Today, I still have some of my skill because I managed to solidify the game's principles and mechanics through analysis.[/color]

[color=#F1E0F3]I like to play, talk, and hang out. I enjoy sharing lobbies, explaining things, and teaching what I know, because learning alone is fun, but learning with someone else is more fulfilling. If I can help someone improve, I do it without hesitation.[/color]

[color=#EFE3F4]Sometimes, while you're talking to me, it might seem like I don't have much emotional empathy. It's not intentional.[/color]
[color=#ECE6F6]I often feel detached from what's happening to me, as if I were someone observing from within another person moving through this tangible world. Not from some dark place, just… distant.[/color]

[color=#E9E8F7]Besides osu!, I'm passionate about chess, philosophy, graphic design, and technology.[/color]
[color=#E7EBF8]I'm a realist: the outcome matters to me. But sometimes I try to see things differently and enjoy the process, or simply the experience of living life.[/color]

[color=#E4EEF9]If you're looking for someone perfect, it's not me.[/color]

[color=#E1F1FA]And maybe the way I talk makes you think I'm pessimistic or bitter.[/color]

[color=#DEF4FC]Actually, I just exaggerate things and see life as a tragicomedy:[/color]
[color=#DCF7FD]life is a trolling compilation, and I'm just another contemporary troll.[/color]

[color=#D9FAFE]Yes, I can be a troll and cute at the same time. Deal with it, it's who I am. >w<[/color]

